    <description>Flow for LOTO 480-up, display general questions needed for Loto 480-up operations.
6/28: Screen shows general questions for LOTO on 480-up operations. Added conditional text displays if dispatcher has notes, added chart and LOTO link for associated. Debugging screen, uppercasing conditionals, subassembly screen separations. Changed picklist to radio buttons, added recordId for mobile users
7/7: Split question two to two questions on power and assembly, add LOTO chart to screen, change label to technician response. Fixed UI for format consistency. Using either currentUserId (for dispatcher mode) or UserId (for technician) to sign - move logic around to accommodate for both dispatcher and technician modes. Save Lgen SN to data validation record for work approvals.
8/26: Changes requested from user testing - split work approval into two steps. Add more inputs for collection and clean-up. Validation on acknowledgment checkbox</description>
